  "summary": "偶数 n 的排列按指定奇偶下标规则反复重排，求首次恢复初始排列的操作次数。",
  "insight": "只跟踪初始值 1 的位置即可；一次变换后，旧位置偶数映射为 position/2，奇数映射为 n/2+(position-1)/2。它回到一时整个排列周期结束。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "至少执行一次操作",
    "跟踪的是元素位置的映射",
    "n=2 答案为一"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "track-single-position-cycle",
      "title": "单位置周期模拟",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "排列变换的整体周期等于元素一的位置周期。",
      "steps": [
        "position=1，operations=0",
        "do 根据 position 奇偶更新位置，operations++",
        "while position!=1，返回 operations"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(answer)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/track-single-position-cycle/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/track-single-position-cycle/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/track-single-position-cycle/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
